  "description": "Emits host deploy-config at build time: a Netlify/Cloudflare-Pages `_redirects` file and a meta-refresh HTML page for every declared redirect (so renamed or moved pages don't 404 on any static host), plus a `_headers` file (with sensible immutable-caching defaults for the content-hashed asset directories, and any rules you add). Redirects come from `UseRedirects(...)` config and from a `redirect_from` key in page frontmatter.",
